.TH "PB-TEAM-ACTIVITY" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-team-activity - Search the team audit log (owners, admins, auditors)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb team activity <team> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Search the team audit log, newest first. Owners, admins and auditors can read it. Filter by actor (account ID, email or API token), action or action prefix, target, result (success or denied) and time range, or search text. Each event shows when, who, what, the result and the target. Use --json for the documented event shape and the next page cursor.

.PP
Events are kept for the plan's retention period (Team 365 days); export them with pb team activity export.

.PP
Teams use explicit membership and resource grants. Membership alone does not grant machine use, ENV values, previews, or tunnels. Mutations use the current team generation to reject stale edits; read pb team get before retrying a conflicting change.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--action\fP=""
	action, or a prefix such as team or billing

.PP
\fB--actor\fP=""
	account ID, email or API token ID

.PP
\fB--cursor\fP=""
	next_cursor from the previous page

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for activity

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print the events as JSON, with next_cursor

.PP
\fB--limit\fP=50
	maximum events, 1–200

.PP
\fB--result\fP=""
	success or denied

.PP
\fB--search\fP=""
	text in the action, target name or actor email

.PP
\fB--since\fP=""
	start: RFC 3339 time or a duration ago such as 24h or 7d

.PP
\fB--target\fP=""
	target resource or machine ID

.PP
\fB--until\fP=""
	end: RFC 3339 time or a duration ago


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-team(1)\fP, \fBpb-team-activity-export(1)\fP
